    },
    {
      "id": "d508135816a84473a023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1780,
      "y": 145,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#D8DEE8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a50",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 783471137,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 349297013,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761822000050,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A market has exactly two outcomes:\n   one YES and one NO record.\n\n2. All BUY and SELL orders live in one\n   ORDER collection. The outcome is\n   identified by marketOutcomeId.\n\n3. Cash balances are integer cents:\n   availableUsdCents + lockedUsdCents.\n\n4. Position accounting:\n   availableQuantity + lockedQuantity.\n\n5. A trade references two orders:\n   buyOrderId and sellOrderId. One order\n   may be filled by multiple trades.\n\n6. Store prices as integer cents\n   (63 means $0.63).\n\n7. TX_LOG.amount is signed integer:\n   cents for USD, contract units for\n   CONTRACT. referenceType + referenceId\n   is polymorphic, not a normal FK.\n\n8. Update balances, orders, trades, and\n   ledger entries atomically in a DB\n   transaction.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. A market has exactly two outcomes:\n   one YES and one NO record.\n\n2. All BUY and SELL orders live in one\n   ORDER collection. The outcome is\n   identified by marketOutcomeId.\n\n3. Cash balances are integer cents:\n   availableUsdCents + lockedUsdCents.\n\n4. Position accounting:\n   availableQuantity + lockedQuantity.\n\n5. A trade references two orders:\n   buyOrderId and sellOrderId. One order\n   may be filled by multiple trades.\n\n6. Store prices as integer cents\n   (63 means $0.63).\n\n7. TX_LOG.amount is signed integer:\n   cents for USD, contract units for\n   CONTRACT. referenceType + referenceId\n   is polymorphic, not a normal FK.\n\n8. Update balances, orders, trades, and\n   ledger entries atomically in a DB\n   transaction.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2980e35fe8dc4f588541",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
